  "question": {
    "text": "The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>-value of a nuclear reaction and kinetic energy of the projectile particle, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></math> are related as&nbsp;",
